{
  "id": "system-title-mismatch-does-not-eliminate",
  "added": "2026-09-21",
  "why": "System-generated titles count as inherited (operator rule). A Season or Episode registered without a supplied title carries one the registry built from its parent -- 'The Series: Season 1, Episode 7' -- which no real episode title will match. Since 0.19.0 a one-sided system-generated title is COMPARED (0.45 here), and before 2.13.0 that comparison dragged this pair, identical on parent, number, date, length and director, to 53.2 Review. With T3 the title leaves the denominator; the pair then rests at 79.0 Review under the standing rule that a pair with no title evidence never auto-accepts -- held for a human, not eliminated, which is exactly the rule. score_min 70 pins the exemption; verdict_not_in Accept pins that it does not overreach into an auto-match on a title the record never asserted.",
